---
import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { presets } from '../data/examples';
---
<MarketingLayout title="Configure Concise — Your rules and exceptions" description="Choose from eight writing presets and 47 categories. Enable optional checks, configure exceptions, or try findings without blocking.">
  <header class="page-intro frame"><h1>Configure Concise</h1><p>The basics run out of the box. Turn on the style checks when you want them.</p></header>
  <section class="frame page-section" aria-labelledby="preset-heading">
    <div class="config-grid">
      <div class="preset-picker"><h2 id="preset-heading">Choose a preset.</h2><p>Eight starting points, from removing chat boilerplate to checking all 47 writing categories. This example enables the optional em-dash and AI-writing checks.</p><label for="preset">Writing preset</label><select id="preset">{presets.map(preset => <option value={preset.id}>{preset.id}</option>)}</select><div class="preset-info" aria-live="polite"><strong data-preset-count>21 categories</strong><p data-preset-description>{presets[0].description}</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/docs/categories/">Compare all presets <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a><noscript><p>The example uses the default preset. See the preset reference for other values.</p></noscript></div>
      <div class="config-code" data-ui><div class="terminal-meta"><span>.claude/concise.json</span><button class="copy-button" data-copy="config"><Icon name="copy" size={15} /><span>Copy</span></button></div><pre><code data-config-code>{`{
  "features": {
    "emDash": { "enabled": true },
    "aiWriting": {
      "enabled": true,
      "preset": "default"
    }
  }
}`}</code></pre><p>Codex uses <code>.codex/concise.json</code>.<br />If both exist, the Claude configuration wins.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="exceptions"><p><strong>Keep an intentional phrase.</strong> Use <code>concise-ignore</code>, allow a phrase, or exempt a file. Style checks default to confirm mode: resubmit identical text to keep it.</p><p><strong>Try it without blocking.</strong> Set <code>softFail: true</code> to receive findings as flagged allows. It is off by default.</p></div>
  </section>
  <nav class="page-next frame" aria-label="Configuration references"><a class="text-link" href="/docs/configuration/">Every option and config layer <Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a><a class="text-link" href="/docs/environment/">Session overrides <Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a><a class="text-link" href="/console/">Edit settings in the console <Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a></nav>
</MarketingLayout>
